   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MoodCraft · Text to image (Flux Klein)\n\nType a prompt in Positive and run. 20 steps, CFG 3.5, euler/simple.\n\nModels (Flux 3 Image Klein, int8): diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-int8-convrot.safetensors, text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (type flux3), vae/flux2-vae.safetensors.\n\nSame graph MoodCraft queues; the app fills in prompt, seed, size and images itself. Core ComfyUI nodes only."
